        rdfs:label "Asterias rubens Turing wavelength at 115.2 µm (Holocene, Pass 2) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 78/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The figure still shows the real animal, its outline, and the activator, and the GIF ends on the photograph. Pass 2 states why that outline is not the micro-domain. The photograph remains an unscaled studio plate, so the tubercle field is not a pixel fit at 115.2 µm." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
